Combine robust regression estimation (M or MM) with multiway clustered standard errors.
----------------------

 ^robcluster2^
 
Description
-----------

^robcluster2^ Combine robust regression estimation (M or MM) with multiway clustered standard errors.
     
^Note:^ Requires robcluster2.ado by Olah Data Semarang

Examples
--------

 . ^robcluster2 mm robcluster2 robcluster2_1 robcluster2_2 robcluster2_3, eff(95) cluster(Id Year)^

